              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.19.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 19:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nami nindaapha roho ya mbazi na mavoyo, atu a nyumba ya Daudi na asagalao Jerusalemu, ili ndiphomlola iye ariyemdunga fumo, amsononekere dza mutu amsononekeravyo mwanawe wa macheye na amririravyo mwanawe wa kpwandza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo atu a Jerusalemu andakala na sonono kulu dza vyokala wakati wa kumsononekera Hadadi-Rimoni ko tsi ya kugbwa ya Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu a yo tsi andakala na sonono, chila mryango chivyakpwe. Atu a mryango wa nyumba ya Daudi chivyao, na achetu ao nao chivyao; atu a mryango wa nyumba ya Nathani chivyao, na achetu ao nao chivyao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu a mryango wa nyumba ya Lawi andakala chivyao, na achetu ao nao chivyao; atu a mryango wa Shimei",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shimei ni mdzukulu wa Lawi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " chivyao, na achetu ao nao chivyao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na atu a miryango yosi chiyosala andasononeka chivyao na achetu ao nao chivyao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
